37: | Item | State |
38: |---|---|
39: | Full suite | `Ran 572 tests ... OK (skipped=6)`, exit 0 — `raw/orch_full_suite_after_ao01_fix_clean.log` |
40: | Focused packaging + fallback | `Ran 47 tests ... OK` (44 before, plus the 3 new `AO-01` cases) |
41: | Write set | clean against the fixed Stage-A tip `52542c39` |
42: | Claim ceiling | unchanged: `CODE_CANDIDATE_READY_PENDING_PUBLISH` at best; no Portal, no Host UAT, no `S4_FULL_PASS` |
43: | Re-verification | dispatched as a fresh independent lane on the new commit, copying the subject outside the tree |

